    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &quot;Atlas Protocol&quot;, a challenging escape room set in a mysterious abandoned facility. Do you have what it takes to unravel its secrets and discover what has happened?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 Puzzles to Solve: A variety of puzzles that will test your skills and keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Exploration: Discover detailed environments full of clues that will guide you to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Narrative: As you progress, unveil a mystery that will make sense of your surroundings and your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for Escape Room Fans: Designed for those who love mental challenges and unraveling mysteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &quot;Atlas Protocol&quot;, a challenging escape room set in a mysterious abandoned facility. Do you have what it takes to unravel its secrets and discover what has happened?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 Puzzles to Solve: A variety of puzzles that will test your skills and keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Exploration: Discover detailed environments full of clues that will guide you to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Narrative: As you progress, unveil a mystery that will make sense of your surroundings and your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for Escape Room Fans: Designed for those who love mental challenges and unraveling mysteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You appear in an abandoned facility without knowing how or when you arrived. &quot;Atlas Protocol&quot; will immerse you in an intriguing adventure full of mystery and suspense. Will you be able to unravel the enigma hidden in every corner? Dare to find out.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
